cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Interatrial shunt digital twins for HFrEF and HFpEF"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Eskuri
    given-names: Alan
    affiliation: InterShunt Technologies
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-11-11
abstract: >-
  Closed-loop lumped-parameter cardiovascular model with an interatrial shunt,
  two hand-tuned digital twins (HFrEF and HFpEF), and scenario scripts for
  exercise, pulmonary vascular disease, volume retention and reflex arms.
  Model design, code and simulations were produced with Claude (Anthropic)
  under the author's direction.
